<section class="page-head wrap"><h1>About Murtaza</h1><h2>Remote Business Advisor</h2></section>
<section class="section wrap content-page about-page"><figure class="about-portrait"><img src="/images/murtaza-saeed-profile-web.jpg" alt="Portrait of Murtaza Saeed" width="520" height="520" /><figcaption>Murtaza Saeed<br /><span>Remote Business Advisor</span></figcaption></figure><div class="prose">
<p>I am a former Chief Finance Manager with more than 35 years of experience across finance, business operations, systems and general management.</p>
<p>Although much of my career was grounded in finance, my work increasingly involved the wider business: how information flows, how decisions are made, where processes break down, how systems support management and how organisations can improve performance.</p>
<h2 id="a-practical-business-perspective">A Practical Business Perspective</h2>
<p>My experience has involved working with management teams, operational businesses and business systems where good decisions depend on more than accurate numbers.</p>
<p>Over the years, I have developed a particular interest in:</p>
<ul>
<li>business and performance reviews;</li>
<li>business analysis and strategic decisions;</li>
<li>information systems and process improvement; and</li>
<li>the practical use of technology, including AI, to improve how businesses operate.</li>
</ul>
<p>I value clear thinking, sound judgement and practical solutions that can work in the real world.</p>
<h2 id="what-i-am-doing-now">What I Am Doing Now</h2>
<p>Although I have retired from full-time corporate life, I remain professionally engaged and continue to follow business, management and technology closely.</p>
<p>I am available for focused remote assignments with businesses in Kenya, the UK and other international markets.</p>
<p>My current work centres on three areas:</p>
<ul class="advisory-services"><li>Business Performance Reviews</li><li>Business Analysis &amp; Strategy</li><li>Information Systems &amp; Process Improvement</li></ul>
<h2 id="why-murtaza-insights-exists">Why Murtaza Insights Exists</h2>
<p><em>Murtaza Insights</em> is my independent publishing home.</p>
<p>I use it to examine business decisions, management issues, systems, technology and changing business practices from a practitioner’s perspective.</p>
<p>The aim is to provide clear, practical and independent thinking rather than corporate or promotional commentary.</p>
<p>The articles also give prospective clients a sense of how I approach business problems and the kinds of questions I ask before reaching a conclusion.</p>
<p>Biz Buzz explores the unusual, surprising and occasionally amusing side of business &amp; life.</p>
